-----------------------------------------------

`@imgly/background-removal@1.7.0` is AGPL-3.0. The package's `LICENSE.md`
opens with the GNU Affero General Public License v3 and there is no MIT
anywhere in it. It is a runtime dependency, dynamically imported by the
Background tool, linked into the same bundle as this application's own MIT
